mythicos-dev-tools (1.0.0) lucid; urgency=medium

  * Initial fork of Linux Mint's mint-dev-tools for MythicOS.
  * Renamed all mint-* binaries to mythicos-* (cinnamon-stats-tracker
    became cinnade-stats-tracker to match the Cinnade DE fork naming).
  * Moved shared data from /usr/share/mint-dev-tools to
    /usr/share/mythicos-dev-tools and fixed every internal path
    reference accordingly.
  * Renamed the GSettings schema from com.linuxmint.dev to
    fr.hastag.mythicos.dev.
  * Rebranded package metadata (control, maintainer) for MythicOS /
    Studio Hastag.

 -- Adam <contact@hastag.fr>  Mon, 24 Aug 2026 12:00:00 +0200
